  "description": "ASP.NET Core structured logging and log shipping SDK with automatic HTTP request/response logging middleware, manual application events, searchable metadata, in-memory buffering, batching, and HTTPS delivery to the Pinqloq centralized log management platform.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
