  "published": "2026-07-20T11:10:44.29Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: the DeviceUid field is renamed to Identifier and is now required — the ingest API rejects logs with an empty Identifier (single log to 400, batch entry skipped). Populate it per log via PinqloqLogEntry.Identifier, globally via PinqloqOptions.Identifier, or per request. The request-logging middleware now reads the \"identifier\" request header automatically; SetIdentifier overrides it and falls back to the header then to PinqloqOptions.Identifier. Also adds SetAppVersionName to override AppVersionName per request. The package now multi-targets net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0 (previously net9.0 only).",
